10	boys and girls army camp of 2024	It's situated at the foothills of the Sahyadri mountain ranges, on 7,015 acres of land, and is surrounded by hills and a large lake. The NDA is about 28 kilometers from Pune airport and 18 kilometers from Pune railway station. Visitors can take cabs, auto/car rentals, or buses to get to the NDA from these locations. \r\nNational Defence Academy\r\nHistory of National Defence Academy\r\nNational Defence Academy is located on south-west of Pune city and north-west of Khadakwas...\r\n\r\nPIB\r\nPress Release:Press information Bureau - PIB\r\n16 Oct 2023 — The NDA is located in Khadakwasla, Pune, Maharashtra and situated at the foothi...\r\nNational Defence Academy\r\nContact Us - National Defence Academy\r\nOne can fly to Pune from several International / Domestic airports. The National Defence A...\r\n\r\nMilind Misal\r\n…National Defence Academy where cadets of the three services, Army,Navy and the Air Force train together. The NDA is located in Khadakwasla, Pune, Maharashtra.\r\nThe NDA has a 21-kilometer running track that takes runners through the campus's scenic beauty. It also has Peacock Bay, which is located northeast of Khadakwasla Lake and is the center for watermanship training. The bay has sailing boats, speed boats, wind surfers, water skis, whalers, dinghies, and cutters, as well as seamanship training equipment. The bay is also home to peacocks, deer, lion-tailed monkeys, and civets.	NDA, Khadakwasla, Pune, Maharashtra, India	2024-09-15 10:31:00+05:30	2024-09-20 10:00:00+05:30	collage official	events/images/national-defence-academy-1.webp	all students	2024-08-15 13:26:48.364357+05:30	2024-08-15 15:17:41.214067+05:30	5
11	Independence day 2024	Independence Day 2024 Live Updates: Prime Minister Narendra Modi addressed the nation from ramparts of Red Fort on 78th Independence Day. This was be Prime Minister 11th Independence Day speech. Frequent natural disaster incidents, Viksit Bharat by 2047, Atmanirbhar Bharat, youth skill development, and women's safety were among the key issues mentioned by PM Modi in his address speech.	amity university greater noida	2024-09-15 10:00:00+05:30	2024-08-15 01:00:00+05:30	collage official	events/images/independence-day-2024-2024-08-f441fc982edf2d6e68d58bb88857d2b0-scaled.jpg	all students	2024-08-15 15:34:05.587282+05:30	2024-09-14 18:33:36.897882+05:30	5
